# Arguments for rezoagwe-bootstrap. See rezoagwe-bootstrap -h.
#
#   -port     UDP and TCP port to listen on (default 9999)
#   -cluster  cluster name; nodes only talk to their own cluster
#   -psk      pre-shared key authenticating every packet
#
# Without a -psk the framing key comes from the cluster name alone: that keeps
# two clusters on one network apart, but provides no secrecy.
REZOAGWE_BOOTSTRAP_ARGS="-port 9999"
